# Public browser configuration only. Never put database/signing/provider secrets here.
# Empty means same-origin /api; local Vite proxies it to 127.0.0.1:8000.
# A separate hosted API must use HTTPS and exact credentialed CORS/cookie settings.
VITE_API_ORIGIN=
# Set an origin only (https://api.example.com), with no path/query/credentials.
# Hosted web/API on unrelated sites require COOKIE_SAMESITE=none, Secure cookies,
# and exact FRONTEND_ORIGINS on the API. Prefer same-site custom domains;
# browser third-party-cookie restrictions must be checked in Phase 10.
